  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 304.02 Exemption. Premium financing plans requiring the delivery of the prospectus filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission under the Securities Act of 1933 shall be exempt from the provisions and requirements of this part.\n\nSource. #1942, eff 2-1-82; ss by #4287, eff 7-1-87; ss by #5657, eff 7-1-93; ss by #7015, INTERIM, eff 7-1-99, EXPIRED: 10-29-99\n\nNew. #7450, eff 2-16-01, EXPIRED: 2-16-09\n\nNew. #12399, eff 9-30-17",
